				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem a deo per suum ipsius Christum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Veritus sum, ne vos <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>(venerabiles viri, pręceptores et fratres in Christo dilectissimi) vel <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ingratitudinis vel negligentię me accusaretis, si <persName ref="p8437">Erasmo</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8437">Erasmus Schmid</persName>.</note> illi nostro <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad vos proficiscenti literas non dedissem, quum tot menses iam literas <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ad vos dederim nullas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Bekannt sind nur die von <persName ref="p21247">Froschs</persName> Hand stammenden Briefe der <placeName ref="l411">Reichenweirer</placeName> Pfarrer an die <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> vom 16. September und vom 4. Oktober 1535 (<bibl source="b7">HBBW V</bibl>, <ref target="file10688">Nr. 650</ref> und 658).</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quanquam sane mei causa nullis modo literis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>apud vos opus erat, quod <persName ref="p8437">Erasmus</persName> ipse mea sit apud vos futurus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>epistola, ut qui optime cognovit, quo ingenio quove sim in vos animo, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tamen non potui non scribere, modo gratarer vobis super <persName ref="p8437">Erasmo</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hactenus ad nos deducto, modo iterum expeterem illum a vobis apostolum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nobis remittendum<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Der vom <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Rat bewilligte Einsatz <persName ref="p8437">Schmids</persName> im Herrschaftsgebiet von <persName ref="p8098">Georg von Württemberg</persName> war bis zum 24. Juni 1536 befristet (vgl. oben <ref target="file10875">Nr. 836</ref> mit Anm. 11).</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nam illud haudquaquam silentio prętereundum est, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod ille non solum eruditione, pietate ac omnis generis virtutibus commendatum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>se pręstitit, verum etiam sudando, docendo, vigilando et sufferendo sese <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>talem exhibuit, ut omnes in admirationem sui rapuerit, et non potuerit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>non multum fructus Christo adtulisse, id quod in rudi plebecula nos <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>officiis pręfecti quotidie experimur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Et hoc est testimonium, quod nos il<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>li damus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quamobrem, quoad mea interest, vos omnes (vir<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>i d<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>octissimi simul atque integerrimi) per necessitudinem et unionem illam, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quam nostra, <persName ref="p8437">Erasmo</persName> mediante, cum vestra contraxit ecclesia, obsecro <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et obtestor, velitis apud inclytum urbis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> senatum et magistratus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>huius negocii curam arripere et, si quid Poteritis, persuadere et efficere, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut <persName ref="p8437">Erasmus</persName> noster nobis in aliquot annos a piis magistratibus vestris <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>remittatur<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Zur Sache vgl. im weiteren die Briefe <ref target="file10887">Nr. 848</ref> und 854.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Quod quidem in laudem et gloriam nominis dei et <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>animarum salutem fęliciter est cessurum; vos vero vestro verbi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>divini propagandi officio hac ratione minime deeritis, quod michi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tam gratum futurum est quam quę gratissima.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Valete in Christo, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>domini et fratres charissimi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l411">Richevilla</placeName>, 15. iunii anno etc. <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>36.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p21247">Johannes Froschius</persName>, quęstor et <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>annonę <placeName ref="l411">Richevillensis</placeName> pręfectus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Venerabilibus viris, pietate pariter ac <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eruditione conspicuis pastoribus, doctoribus <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>et ministris verbi urbis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>dominis et fratribus suis in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>charissimis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>